1
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:16,340
(Meow!) Hey humans, listen up!
（喵！）人類，聽好了！

2
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:17,920
Bow your heads and show respect!
低下頭，向本喵致敬！

3
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,620
Keep your eyes on me right now!
現在眼睛都看著本喵！

4
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:21,760
Your royal cat is stepping out!
尊貴的貓王要出場！

5
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,320
This ain't just ordinary fur
這不是普通的毛，

6
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,060
It's a gift from your feline ruler
這是貓咪君王賜予的禮物。

7
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:26,960
Lying around with a lazy yawn
懶洋洋躺著打個哈欠，

8
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,760
Dropping little treasures all day long
整天掉下小小寶物。

9
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:31,220
Roll around, it's everywhere
翻個身，毛就撒滿地，

10
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:35,300
Take two steps, more floating hair
走兩步，又多了飄飛的毛。

11
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:38,060
Doing nothing, still supreme
什麼都不做，依然至高無上，

12
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:41,980
You're counting pennies, I'm living the dream
你在數零錢，本喵活得像夢一樣。

13
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:45,900
Bubu's royal shedding fur (Hey!)
布布尊貴的掉毛（嘿！）

14
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:50,020
So precious you don't dare breathe it in (Don't breathe it in!)
珍貴到你不敢吸進去（別吸進去！）

15
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:53,300
Stretch all day and treasures grow
整天伸懶腰，寶物自然長，

16
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:57,120
Do you want it? Let me know
想不想要？告訴本喵。

17
00:00:57,120 --> 00:01:00,740
Bubu's royal shedding fur (Meow!)
布布尊貴的掉毛（喵！）

18
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:03,780
Every strand has attitude to show
每一根都展現傲嬌氣息，

19
00:01:03,780 --> 00:01:07,040
Drop your cash and walk away
放下錢，人就可以走，

20
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:12,120
Whether you get some depends on my day
拿不拿得到，要看本喵今天心情。

21
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:16,520
Official label, genuine cat
官方標籤，正宗本喵，

22
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:18,300
No cheap imitation can copy that
廉價仿品誰都學不來。

23
00:01:18,300 --> 00:01:20,180
Every strand says "Leave me alone"
每一根都寫著「別煩我」，

24
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:22,060
Allergic? Your faith just isn't strong
過敏？只是你的信仰不夠堅定。

25
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:23,600
You're shouting prices, eight-eight-eight
你在那裡喊價，八八八，

26
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:25,360
Making my ears shake with your debate
吵得本喵耳朵跟著抖。

27
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:27,300
I flick my tail and say bye-bye
本喵甩甩尾巴說再見，

28
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:29,120
One more chance to please me, don't ask why
再給你一次討好機會，別問為什麼。

29
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:32,620
Bubu's royal shedding fur (Meow meow!)
布布尊貴的掉毛（喵喵！）

30
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:36,060
So precious you don't dare breathe it in (You're shaking now!)
珍貴到你不敢吸進去（你已經在發抖！）

31
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:39,320
Stretch all day and treasures grow
整天伸懶腰，寶物自然長，

32
00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:43,100
Do you want it? Let me know
想不想要？告訴本喵。

33
00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:46,100
Bubu's royal shedding fur (Hey!)
布布尊貴的掉毛（嘿！）

34
00:01:46,620 --> 00:01:49,640
Every strand has attitude to show
每一根都展現傲嬌氣息，

35
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:52,840
Drop your cash and walk away
放下錢，人就可以走，

36
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:57,840
Whether you get some depends on my day
拿不拿得到，要看本喵今天心情。

37
00:01:57,840 --> 00:02:01,260
Today I shed across your bed
今天本喵掉滿你的床，

38
00:02:01,260 --> 00:02:04,740
Tomorrow I might take it back instead
明天可能又全部收回來。

39
00:02:04,740 --> 00:02:08,100
Next day I'm happy, might swallow it all
後天心情好，可能全吞下肚，

40
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:12,700
You'll just scroll through my photos on your phone (Meow!)
你只剩滑手機看本喵的照片（喵！）

41
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:16,000
Bubu's royal shedding fur
布布尊貴的掉毛，

42
00:02:16,660 --> 00:02:19,700
Getting some means you've earned my favor
拿得到，表示你贏得本喵青睞。

43
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:23,180
This ain't shopping, it's a holy honor
這不是購物，是神聖的榮耀，

44
00:02:23,180 --> 00:02:26,820
Bow down lower, don't make a sound
頭再低一點，不要出聲。

45
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:30,060
Bubu's royal shedding fur (Meow~)
布布尊貴的掉毛（喵～）

46
00:02:30,340 --> 00:02:33,180
That's my final royal word
這就是本喵最後的諭令，

47
00:02:33,180 --> 00:02:36,360
Drop your cash and walk away
放下錢，人就可以走，

48
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:41,500
Line up and worship me all day (Meow meow!)
整天排隊朝拜本喵吧（喵喵！）
